# Internal planning scratch (superpowers-driven design/plan docs). Kept locally
# as a development trail; not part of the published repo.
docs/superpowers/

# Session artifacts from /handoff + /resume flows. The active HANDOFF.md
# is tracked; rolling backups and consumed-archive renames are not.
HANDOFF.md.bak
HANDOFF.md.resumed-*

# Regenerable intelligence context packet (derived read-only view written by
# `cadence resume`/`handoff`). Re-created on demand from live state — not a
# tracked artifact, unlike the recommendation/milestone ledgers beside it.
.cadence/intelligence/context/

# MCP tool-trust grant ledger (`cadence mcp trust grant/revoke/list`).
# Operator/machine-local security material bound to a specific CADENCE
# version and expiry — unlike state.json, not shared planning state.
.cadence/mcp-trust.json

# Local-only reference docs (architecture reviews, scratch notes). Kept on
# disk for the operator; never published.
.local/

# Local launch-prep materials (editorial, pegged to a release; regenerated as
# needed). Kept on disk for the operator; never published.
LAUNCH-NUMBERS.md
docs/CADENCE-LAUNCH-HANDOFF.md
ARCHITECTURE-BRIEF.md
OBJECTION-FAQ.md
COMPETITIVE.md
launch/
.deja/
# cadence-owned ephemeral state (see docs/concepts.md)
.cadence/state.json
.cadence/STATE.md

# Ad hoc scratch dump for pasted-in external bug reports / triage input.
# Not repo content — never published.
/dumpfile

# Local flywheel session-capture tooling (dogfooded against this repo, not
# part of it). Daemon spool/pid state, degraded-capture markers (can appear
# in any package dir), and the pre-install settings.json backup.
.flywheel/
.flywheel-DEGRADED
.claude/settings.json.pre-flywheel-*
